d lounges (London, Dubai, Istanbul, Hong Kong, Vancouver, Sydney, Beijing).</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td data-th=\"&nbsp;\">\n                <span class=\"bt-content\">Passenger access</span>\n            </td>\n            <td data-th=\"Sky Team Airlines Lounges\">\n                <span class=\"bt-content\">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Saudia First Class passenger.</li>\n                        <li>Saudia Business Class passenger.</li>\n                        <li>AlFursan Gold Member travelling Economy Class (on Saudia or Sky Team member airline).</li>\n                        <li>Sky Team Elite Plus Member travelling Economy Class on Saudia.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n            <td data-th=\"Sky Team Branded Lounges\">\n                <span class=\"bt-content\">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Saudia First Class passenger.</li>\n                        <li>Saudia Business Class passenger.</li>\n                        <li>AlFursan Gold Member travelling Economy Class (on Saudia or Sky Team member airline).</li>\n                        <li>AlFursan Silver Member travelling Economy Class on a Saudia flight.</li>\n                        <li>Sky Team Elite Plus Member travelling Economy Class on Saudia.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td data-th=\"&nbsp;\">\n                <span class=\"bt-content\">Guest / Family</span>\n            </td>\n            <td data-th=\"Sky Team Airlines Lounges\">\n                <span class=\"bt-content\">\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>AlFursan Gold Member: May invite a guest.</li>\n                        <li>Sky Team Elite Plus Member: May invite a guest.</li>\n                        <li>Guests must be travelling on the same